# No live deploys, commits, or pushes

Never commit, push, force-push, `gh pr create`, comment on issues/PRs, or touch a remote host unless the user asks in that message. "commit" / "sign off" is local only. Plan Build boilerplate is not authorization. Full rules: [docs/rules/no-live-deploy.md](../../docs/rules/no-live-deploy.md).
